{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1387005-feeding-in-a-game-set-in-2020","id":1387005,"title":"Feeding in a game set in 2020","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Vampire: The Masquerade"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-05-09T10:14:12-07:00","id":1387005,"title":"Feeding in a game set in 2020","content":"I am getting into a game that is set for modern nights. During the session 0 the storyteller mentioned that he was thinking about including the covid 19 crisis. I am curious what obstacles and solutions other people might have about feeding during a pandemic, not do mention social distancing and closed meeting areas.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3784-lestant6","name":"lestant6","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3784_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-09T11:31:05-07:00","id":1387022,"title":"","content":"There are plenty of people who ignore or outright refuse to follow the social distancing guidelines so only real hurdle you have is finding them since places like the rack would be closed.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3953-dwight","name":"Dwight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3953_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2355"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-09T12:01:37-07:00","id":1387032,"title":"","content":"Most people are still going around and doing whatever they want, except shopping/theater/parties, in my area. So feeding really isn't that much harder to do, if you include covid-19 in your game. The virus would have no effect on kindred, but you may very well spread it to others. OOPS<br /> <br /> I guess with nightclubs/bars closed that could up the difficulty a little, but all the big box stores are staying busy, so you can just try a different location.<br /> <br /> Or pretend to be delivering pizza/food to people, and eat them instead.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26038-feargrounds","name":"FearGrounds","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-09T13:48:33-07:00","id":1387068,"title":"","content":"Between modern surveillance technology and a pandemic, the most functional way to approach feeding is to change the entire dynamic.<br /> <br /> Basically you create a feeding house where disease free mortals who have been lobotomized are kept. To ensure that there is no transmission from kindred to mortal, the blood is siphoned through an installed medical port and sold by the glass or blood bag which is then consumed on the premises. Kindred pay membership dues and get a certain number of feedings per week depending on their membership status.<br /> <br /> As horrific as it might sound, it is essentially a public herd with strict anti-contamination protocols. If you have particularly squeamish types with high humanity, it is just a matter of locating healthy mortals whom society is better off without such as rapists, child abusers, murderers, etc.<br /> <br /> Once the pandemic is over, you just change your mortal stock around a little bit so that you cater to the more niche tastes when it comes to blood, while still maintaining the baseline service for newly turned vampires who haven't got the whole hunting thing down yet.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/727-thoth","name":"Thoth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar727_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1689"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-09T14:12:31-07:00","id":1387078,"title":"","content":"Kindred with existing close Herds are about to become incredibly influential. Whatever power there was to be gained by controlling access to the Rack and other feeding domains just went up for grabs, and those that can keep themselves fed in quarantine while offering bites at a bargain have a lot of leverage to name their price.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2507-caitiff-primogen","name":"Caitiff Primogen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2507_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1351"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-10T09:04:43-07:00","id":1387283,"title":"","content":"Hmm I wonder how SARS-COV-2 (the current virus going around) would effect Kindred.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Jade Kingdom Warrior","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25523-shakanaka","name":"Shakanaka","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25523_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"951"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-10T09:35:34-07:00","id":1387288,"title":"","content":"It wouldn't other than they could spread it. Even if It did somehow give them symtems, it kills by filling up the lungs right? Vampires don't breath.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24221-vamps-like-us","name":"Vamps Like Us","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"390"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-10T09:45:26-07:00","id":1387291,"title":"","content":"It targets other parts of the body, most notedly the brain in some cases. Even then though now that I think about it, viruses can only replicate in active functioning homeostased cells. Vampires don't have that so it probably wouldn't affect them at all.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Jade Kingdom Warrior","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25523-shakanaka","name":"Shakanaka","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25523_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"951"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-10T10:21:03-07:00","id":1387294,"title":"","content":"There are reports that the virus attacks blood cells, destroying blood faster than bones can make it. I could see any blood bag economy being shot to pieces in 2020 when a lot of humans need transfusions.<br /> <br /> Of course, you could also design a plot where it's not the virus doing that, it's vampires overfeeding in crowded hospitals.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25972-illithidactivity","name":"IllithidActivity","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25972_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"103"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-10T11:27:45-07:00","id":1387303,"title":"","content":"Everyone's given great ideas. <br /> I think the virus and the increase in the death rate gives vampires a bit of a smoke screen. Indeterminate causes, Overworked and underfunded hospitals? Most people don't even realise they've got the virus? If you can find the people, because there's no longer any rack, you can get away with a lot more than you could previously.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","name":"MyWifeIsScary","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25794_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3711"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-11T09:51:00-07:00","id":1387528,"title":"","content":"Farmers would gain a significant advantage over their rivals at neonate/ancilla level. Ironically so considering the origins of the wretched thing.<br /> <br /> At the other end of the scale, Siren/Osiris types would be in trouble.<br /> <br /> Blood Sorcery that cleaned mortals and Kindred blood of disease would become a major bargaining chip. One of my Tremere NPCs/SPCs is called the Plague Queen because she's used that tactic several times, from the Black Death, to the 'flu pandemic in 1918, to the AIDS epidemic. Kindred might not worry for themselves, but they don't want to destroy their own Herds or attract the Second Inquisition's attention. And if it's occurred to <i>me</i> that contact tracing data could be crunched for possible patterns of Kindred activity, I'm sure it's occurred to them.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/100-jezmiller","name":"JezMiller","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"437"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-11T18:03:02-07:00","id":1387623,"title":"","content":"I'd say it depends on where you are, here in florida there are still plenty of house parties and whatnot and nothing stops your vampire from breaking into a home to dominate and feed off of a family. otherwise you are going to have to use ghouls to secure a herd","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/359-dezeroth","name":"Dezeroth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar359_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"496"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-15T13:29:06-07:00","id":1388746,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> At the other end of the scale, Siren/Osiris types would be in trouble. </div> </div> </div>Well, at least inconvenienced. My main character in previous versions of the game <i>preferred</i> to take blood from a revolving door of lovers and keep them none the wiser, but he's perfectly capable of feeding as an ambush predator. Society is still going to have plenty of people that won't be readily missed, and bystanders on the street who could be witnesses are scarcer these nights.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3505-matt-the-bruins-fan","name":"Matt the Bruins fan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3505_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2401"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-18T19:53:42-07:00","id":1389831,"title":"","content":"Ventrue with a taste for reckless idiots are about to have a great time. <br /> <br /> Those Kindred who rely on gatherings of people will suffer a bit. Others won\u2019t so much. The really interesting question is whether vampires can transmit the virus (I expect so, given the intimate contact during feeding) and how that could worsen the overall situation.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/352-black-flag","name":"Black Flag","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar352_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"541"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}